74
00:03:47,868 --> 00:03:50,508
佢哋要去少少現代世界啊

75
00:03:50,548 --> 00:03:51,868
Clickety clack

76
00:03:51,908 --> 00:03:52,707
clickety clack

77
00:03:52,747 --> 00:03:54,787
the train is
on the track

78
